            "text": "{\"data\":{\"allEvent\":{\"nodes\":[{\"title\":\"Customer notice: \",\"id\":\"RXh0ZXJuYWxFdmVudDo2MjQ2MA==\",\"description\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">⚠️Please be aware our lift is out of order we are working on resolving this issue as soon as possible. We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause.</span></p>\",\"theaters\":[{\"id\":\"X06X3\"}]},{\"title\":\"Customer Notice:\",\"id\":\"RXh0ZXJuYWxFdmVudDo4MDI0Mw==\",\"description\":\"<p>Please be aware that we are currently experiencing some issues with our air conditioning in Screen 6. When the screen is busy, temperatures may rise. We hope to have the problem solved soon, and apologise for any inconvenience.</p>\",\"theaters\":[{\"id\":\"X079J\"}]}]}}}",
