\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Dune: Part Three\",\"synopsis\":\"Directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Villeneuve and Brian K. Vaughan, Dune: Part Three is based on the novel Dune Messiah by Frank Herbert and delivers the epic conclusion to Villeneuve’s trilogy.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Timothée Chalamet\",\"Zendaya\",\"Jason Momoa\",\"Anya Taylor-Joy\",\"Florence Pugh\",\"Robert Pattinson\",\"Nakoa-Wolf Momoa\",\"Ida Brooke\",\"Rebecca Ferguson\",\"Isaach de Bankolé\"],\"direction\":[\"Denis Villeneuve\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8d/06/8d065acac2e87d06e61d084d431479bb.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/43/d8/43d8ad772ab46cc2047f0c7898b3ec2c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/89/2a/892a190fa9606897ac05754b52d27431.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ea/4c/ea4caa7e923c56c87bb43899d89098b5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/79/aa/79aa859a3e6225b40b318d10aa8c1e68.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/10/60/106038fb6ac90d8fa8650b5ffb7ebf3b.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/cb/d4/cbd4762f3d893ff98bd428309d5c67fb.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fd/d5/fdd5a27e91c58ec942555e4b1cf16691.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/35/56/3556d83cda83d75d5e37406f57d6b9c1.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/57/55/575513b57453c6d0f9ab4b402d25b458.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-12-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/359230_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/359230_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"},\"orderIndex\":15},{\"id\":\"1000050581\",\"title\":\"Dune: Part Three - The IMAX Experience\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Action, Adventure, Science fiction\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"423753\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/7c/ff7c0ee6dc300c54f357ec5b96b5fd78.webp\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Dune: Part Three - The IMAX Experience\",\"synopsis\":\"Directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Villeneuve and Brian K. Vaughan, Dune: Part Three is based on the novel Dune Messiah by Frank Herbert and delivers the epic conclusion to Villeneuve’s trilogy.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/7c/ff7c0ee6dc300c54f357ec5b96b5fd78.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Denis\",\"lastName\":\"Villeneuve\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Timothée\",\"lastName\":\"Chalamet\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"Zendaya\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Momoa\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Anya\",\"lastName\":\"Taylor-Joy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Florence\",\"lastName\":\"Pugh\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-12-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":\"From Warner Bros. Pictures and Legendary Pictures comes Dune: Part Three, bringing Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Denis Villeneuve’s epic trilogy to a breathtaking conclusion. Dune: Part Three is set nearly two decades after Paul Atreides seized control of the Imperium. Now a ruthless Emperor, Paul must face the consequences of his reign as old allies return, terrifying new threats emerge, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by visions of Imperial collapse and the reappearance of his long-lost love, Paul is drawn into a sweeping conspiracy, with Chani at the heart of its unfolding mystery. As rebellion brews and enemies close in, Paul must confront the true cost of power and the fate of those he loves the most. The film stars Oscar nominee Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Jason Momoa, Oscar nominee Florence Pugh, Rebecca Ferguson, Isaach de Bankolé, with Oscar nominee Charlotte Rampling, with Anya Taylor-Joy, and Robert Pattinson, and Oscar winner Javier Bardem. Villeneuve directs from a screenplay by Villeneuve and Brian K. Vaughan, based on the novels written by Frank Herbert. The film is produced by Oscar nominees Mary Parent, Cale Boyter, Villeneuve and Tanya Lapointe, and Joe Caracciolo, and executive produced by Joshua Grode, Thomas Tull, Herbert W. Gains, Brian Herbert, Byron Merritt, Kim Herbert, Kevin J. Anderson, Richard P. Rubinstein, John Harrison and Jessica Derhammer. Joining Villeneuve behind the camera are Oscar-winning director of photography Linus Sandgren, Oscar-winning production designer Patrice Vermette, Oscar-winning editor Joe Walker, Oscar nominated costume designer Jacqueline West, Oscar-nominated casting director Francine Maisler, and Oscar-winning composer Hans Zimmer. Warner Bros. Pictures and Legendary Pictures Present A Legendary Pictures Production, A Film By Denis Villeneuve, Dune: Part Three, only in cinemas December 17, 2026. The film will be distributed worldwide by Warner Bros. Pictures and in China by Legendary East.\\n\\n\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Dune: Part Three - The IMAX Experience\",\"synopsis\":\"From Warner Bros. Pictures and Legendary Pictures comes Dune: Part Three, bringing Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Denis Villeneuve’s epic trilogy to a breathtaking conclusion. Dune: Part Three is set nearly two decades after Paul Atreides seized control of the Imperium. Now a ruthless Emperor, Paul must face the consequences of his reign as old allies return, terrifying new threats emerge, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by visions of Imperial collapse and the reappearance of his long-lost love, Paul is drawn into a sweeping conspiracy, with Chani at the heart of its unfolding mystery. As rebellion brews and enemies close in, Paul must confront the true cost of power and the fate of those he loves the most. The film stars Oscar nominee Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Jason Momoa, Oscar nominee Florence Pugh, Rebecca Ferguson, Isaach de Bankolé, with Oscar nominee Charlotte Rampling, with Anya Taylor-Joy, and Robert Pattinson, and Oscar winner Javier Bardem. Villeneuve directs from a screenplay by Villeneuve and Brian K. Vaughan, based on the novels written by Frank Herbert. The film is produced by Oscar nominees Mary Parent, Cale Boyter, Villeneuve and Tanya Lapointe, and Joe Caracciolo, and executive produced by Joshua Grode, Thomas Tull, Herbert W. Gains, Brian Herbert, Byron Merritt, Kim Herbert, Kevin J. Anderson, Richard P. Rubinstein, John Harrison and Jessica Derhammer. Joining Villeneuve behind the camera are Oscar-winning director of photography Linus Sandgren, Oscar-winning production designer Patrice Vermette, Oscar-winning editor Joe Walker, Oscar nominated costume designer Jacqueline West, Oscar-nominated casting director Francine Maisler, and Oscar-winning composer Hans Zimmer. Warner Bros. Pictures and Legendary Pictures Present A Legendary Pictures Production, A Film By Denis Villeneuve, Dune: Part Three, only in cinemas December 17, 2026. The film will be distributed worldwide by Warner Bros. Pictures and in China by Legendary East.\\n\\n\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Timothée Chalamet\",\"Zendaya\",\"Jason Momoa\",\"Anya Taylor-Joy\",\"Florence Pugh\"],\"direction\":[\"Denis Villeneuve\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-12-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"1000051754\",\"title\":\"Enna Vilai\",\"runtime\":7440,\"genres\":\"Drama, Thriller\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"425219\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1e/c0/1ec039a7b2a9e05d7ec91415e24338ff.png\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Sajeev\",\"lastName\":\"Pazhoor\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Enna Vilai\",\"synopsis\":\"The story follows Thavasi, a humble fisherman from Rameswaram who lives a quiet life with his family until he finds a gold pendant washed ashore. What initially seems like a blessing soon turns into a nightmare when false accusations threaten his peace and dignity, forcing him to stand up against a powerful system.\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Poornima\",\"lastName\":\"Jayaram\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null