vels to a nearby city, where he preys on the family of Harker's fiancée. The only one who may be able to protect them is Dr. van Helsing, Harker's friend and fellow-student of vampires, who is determined to destroy Dracula, whatever the cost.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Horror of Dracula\",\"synopsis\":\"After Jonathan Harker attacks Dracula at his castle (apparently somewhere in Germany), the vampire travels to a nearby city, where he preys on the family of Harker's fiancée. The only one who may be able to protect them is Dr. van Helsing, Harker's friend and fellow-student of vampires, who is determined to destroy Dracula, whatever the cost.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Christopher Lee\",\"Peter Cushing\",\"Michael Gough\",\"Melissa Stribling\",\"Carol Marsh\",\"Olga Dickie\",\"John Van Eyssen\",\"Valérie Gaunt\",\"Janina Faye\",\"Barbara Archer\"],\"direction\":[\"Terence Fisher\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644594.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644592.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644591.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644590.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644589.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/62/47/08/18644588.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Kaleidoscope Entertainment\"},\"orderIndex\":71},{\"id\":\"1000048023\",\"title\":\"Horror Season 2026 Manhunter: The Final Cut\",\"runtime\":7320,\"genres\":\"Thriller\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"420719\"],\"releases\":[],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/db/06db81b2b081bf4a8bd80f285334fe0e.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Mann\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Michael Mann's Manhunter: The Final Cut\",\"synopsis\":\"A retired criminal profiler (William Petersen) reluctantly returns to the FBI to help track down a serial killer of families and is forced to consult an expert—the imprisoned Dr. Hannibal Lecktor (Brian Cox in a subtly chilling performance). The third feature written and directed by Michael Mann is a gripping adaptation of the first of Thomas Harris's four novels featuring the iconic murderer Lecktor, and benefits from the filmmaker's typically striking visuals as well as a top-notch supporting cast, including Tom Noonan as the hunted killer and three-time Oscar nominee Joan Allen as his blind love interest.\\n\\nThis new 4K Final Cut, overseen by Mann, enhances the film’s depth, visual clarity and sound, offering audiences the ultimate immersive version. Shot in 1985, Manhunter was on a frontier in both its subject matter and film form, initiating an impressive list of subsequent films and series.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/db/06db81b2b081bf4a8bd80f285334fe0e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/70f39572ba4de9f910964be15532f397.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William L.\",\"lastName\":\"Petersen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dennis\",\"lastName\":\"Farina\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kim\",\"lastName\":\"Greist\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Horror Season 2026 Manhunter: The Final Cut\",\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Michael Mann's Manhunter: The Final Cut\",\"synopsis\":\"A retired criminal profiler (William Petersen) reluctantly returns to the FBI to help track down a serial killer of families and is forced to consult an expert—the imprisoned Dr. Hannibal Lecktor (Brian Cox in a subtly chilling performance). The third feature written and directed by Michael Mann is a gripping adaptation of the first of Thomas Harris's four novels featuring the iconic murderer Lecktor, and benefits from the filmmaker's typically striking visuals as well as a top-notch supporting cast, including Tom Noonan as the hunted killer and three-time Oscar nominee Joan Allen as his blind love interest.\\n\\nThis new 4K Final Cut, overseen by Mann, enhances the film’s depth, visual clarity and sound, offering audiences the ultimate immersive version. Shot in 1985, Manhunter was on a frontier in both its subject matter and film form, initiating an impressive list of subsequent films and series.\",\"casting\":[\"William L. Petersen\",\"Dennis Farina\",\"Kim Greist\"],\"direction\":[\"Michael Mann\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/70f39572ba4de9f910964be15532f397.jpg\"],\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":30},{\"id\":\"15111\",\"title\":\"Horror Season 2026 The Craft\",\"runtime\":6000,\"genres\":\"Fantasy\",\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0d/1c/0d1cace55d55d824cbbd1f575bc50172.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"4443\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"node