s everything: she doesn’t just enter The Further, she can bring what lives there back to the real world. Once the demons realise her power, our world becomes their playground.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ed/60/ed60da7a9d86edba51614e67ce753e71.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/381911_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/381911_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/fbf61e29dcfd14fa748fc4b55bc0356d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Amelia\",\"lastName\":\"Eve\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Island\",\"lastName\":\"Austin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lin\",\"lastName\":\"Shaye\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sam\",\"lastName\":\"Spruell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Brandon\",\"lastName\":\"Perea\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Maisie\",\"lastName\":\"Richardson-Sellers\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jose