\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/592999.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Travis\",\"lastName\":\"Knight\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Kubo and the Two Strings\",\"synopsis\":\"Clever, kindhearted Kubo ekes out a humble living, telling stories to the people of his seaside town including Hosato, Hashi and Kamekichi. But his relatively quiet existence is shattered when he accidentally summons a spirit from his past which storms down from the heavens to enforce an age-old vendetta. Now on the run, Kubo joins forces with Monkey and Beetle, and sets out on a thrilling quest to save his family and solve the mystery of his fallen father, the greatest samurai warrior the world has ever known. With the help of his shamisen - a magical musical instrument - Kubo must battle gods and monsters to unlock the secret of his legacy, reunite his family, and fulfill his heroic destiny.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/26/be/26bea2d59c70216a0866ddbff4ecb879.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/202207_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/202207_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2022-10-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"12048\",\"name\":\"Park Circus\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"},{\"id\":\"13733\",\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"mild fantasy violence, scary scenes\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"}}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,