 a humble living, telling stories to the people of his seaside town including Hosato, Hashi and Kamekichi. But his relatively quiet existence is shattered when he accidentally summons a spirit from his past which storms down from the heavens to enforce an age-old vendetta. Now on the run, Kubo joins forces with Monkey and Beetle, and sets out on a thrilling quest to save his family and solve the mystery of his fallen father, the greatest samurai warrior the world has ever known. With the help of his shamisen - a magical musical instrument - Kubo must battle gods and monsters to unlock the secret of his legacy, reunite his family, and fulfill his heroic destiny.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Charlize Theron\",\"Art Parkinson\",\"Ralph Fiennes\",\"Rooney Mara\",\"Matthew McConaughey\",\"George Takei\",\"Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa\",\"Brenda Vaccaro\",\"Meyrick Murphy\",\"Minae Noji\"],\"direction\":[\"Travis Knight\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/03/11/09/26/045163.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/03/11/09/26/046257.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/03/11/09/26/047507.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/03/11/09/26/048444.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/591905.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/590343.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/590811.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/591436.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/592374.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/16/07/11/17/35/592999.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2022-10-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"mild fantasy violence, scary scenes\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/202207_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/202207_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Park Circus\"},\"orderIndex\":49},{\"id\":\"1000