rking in private security for his friend Tibu, a billionaire Thai shipping tycoon, life seems quiet – until Tibu winds up dead.\\nNow in the frame for Tibu’s murder, Cole has to go on the run and find the real culprit.\\nEscaping on one of the freight ships, soon Cole is facing off against the cops that are after him, and uncovering corruption and an international conspiracy that goes deeper than he could have ever expected.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d8/80/d8804b656fc0ab5f28737d933273c974.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/363276_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/363276_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5f0a9bcdbbb4b8e16bbc4f16969e262c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Statham\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Annabelle\",\"lastName\":\"Wallis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Roland\",\"lastName\":\"Møller\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Adrian\",\"lastName\":\"Lester\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Wong\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor