hat goes deeper than he could have ever expected.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Jason Statham\",\"Annabelle Wallis\",\"Roland Møller\",\"Adrian Lester\",\"Jason Wong\",\"Ramon Tikaram\",\"Arnas Fedaravicius\",\"Lee Charles\",\"Ben Cartwright\",\"Chaneil Kular\"],\"direction\":[\"Jean-François Richet\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/90/61/9061e091bb556281239a7cd37625bb83.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/09/6b/096b64623da8d025c51c2f8ec134096a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6a/bd/6abdf29c205d1ded0148d76880e6ed28.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/8f/ff8f67a5b77e35c39bb5ca6773bfb7de.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6f/48/6f4847f3d8491a092a3d23a5b0364baf.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/84/dd/84dd72824fff760d8043d3bdb7f9815a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f2/c6/f2c6db3d8a6df8f36991ea117c47892f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a1/4d/a14d1698486eeacaa1a4488b32870ef8.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/05/eb/05eb9f2fd5ccae97c462fcaa290da4f6.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1f/4f/1f4fbdb49e7f7ca5c0e2d77e745a2775.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5f0a9bcdbbb4b8e16bbc4f16969e262c.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-08-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong violence, injury detail, language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/363276_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/363276_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Sky Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"1000050372\",\"title\":\"NCT 127 5TH TOUR ‘NEO CITY : SEOUL - THE REDLINE’ in CINEMAS\",\"runtime\":13200,\"genres\":\"Music, Concert\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"423549\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/90/6d/906d6f0222c8743fb8615af425fc1462.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/95/23/95236838e307a7e7159edce6ddac8b2b.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Kyungchan\",\"lastName\":\"Kim\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Doyeon\",\"lastName\":\"Kim\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Soyoung\",\"lastName\":\"Park\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"NCT 127 5TH TOUR ‘NEO CITY : SEOUL - THE REDLINE’ in CINEMAS\",\"synopsis\":\"NCT 127 5TH TOUR ‘NEO CITY : SEOUL - THE REDLINE’ in CINEMAS brings the explosive opening of NCT 127’s long -awaited return to the big screen through a special live viewing event in theaters around the world. Marking the group’s first tour in a year and eight months, this event captures the scale, energy, and electrifying performances of NCT 127 as they kick off a new chapter of NEO CITY in Seoul.\\n\\nBroadcast live from KSPO DOME, audiences worldwide are invited to experience the intensity of the concert in a cinematic setting, taking in every moment of the setlist, staging, and onstage charisma with fans across the globe. For NCTzens and K -pop audiences alike, this cinematic experience is a chance to witness the heat of THE REDLINE together, beyond borders, on the biggest screen possible.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/90/6d/906d6f0222c8743fb8615af425fc1462.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/2d67a85d0eba0ad783e56e435ee7eda4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"JOHNNY\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"