ve from KSPO DOME, audiences worldwide are invited to experience the intensity of the concert in a cinematic setting, taking in every moment of the setlist, staging, and onstage charisma with fans across the globe. For NCTzens and K -pop audiences alike, this cinematic experience is a chance to witness the heat of THE REDLINE together, beyond borders, on the biggest screen possible.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"JOHNNY\",\"TAEYONG\",\"YUTA\",\"JAEHYUN\",\"HAECHAN\",\"Doyoung\",\"Jungwoo\"],\"direction\":[\"Kyungchan Kim\",\"Doyeon Kim\",\"Soyoung Park\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/2d67a85d0eba0ad783e56e435ee7eda4.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":50},{\"id\":\"1000038597\",\"title\":\"NT Live: All My Sons\",\"runtime\":8100,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"409727\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/29/99/2999043168d6cf3c41bb6843b68d42e5.webp\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/12/e1/12e13316fcc7d553796f6882c5fa510f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1b/77/1b77eafd8fcdd63ab18aec78cdf46201.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c9/62/c962bfd97590ac3a5231f815daf7df64.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5b/40/5b40972000d45494a3d08cbf0f421607.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1f/82/1f82412da6d6bc7d483651473a9bc3bd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/78/92/789211e64c092891db54c6b87c56bfc6.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Ivo\",\"lastName\":\"Van Hove\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"NT Live: All My Sons\",\"synopsis\":\"Bryan Cranston (Breaking Bad) and Marianne Jean-Baptiste (Hard Truths) feature in a five-star, triumphantly acclaimed new production of Arthur Miller’s classic play, from visionary director Ivo Van Hove (A View from the Bridge).\\n\\nOne family, the heart of the American dream. When wartime delivers profits for Joe, it comes at a price when his partner is charged with criminal manufacturing deals, and his eldest son goes missing in action. Will peacetime bring peace of mind, or will he be confronted by the consequence of his actions?\\n\\nFilmed live from the West End, Paapa Essiedu (I May Destroy You), Tom Glynn-Carney (House of the Dragon), and Hayley Squires (I, Daniel Blake) also feature in this disturbingly prescient play.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/29/99/2999043168d6cf3c41bb6843b68d42e5.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/409727_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/409727_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bryan\",\"lastName\":\"Cranston\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marianne\",\"lastName\":\"Jean-Baptiste\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paapa\",\"lastName\":\"Essiedu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\"