han just a quick encounter. They both feel a spark when they meet, but a series of missteps and side quests complicate their night, keeping them apart. As they each race toward and away from each other across the city, they just might discover that the one thing they want most is closer than they think.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e1/6f/e16f607bd0b1213da2e4f62c73250490.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/386711_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/386711_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/734c6199e722489702511706715fe1f5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Monica\",\"lastName\":\"Barbaro\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Callum\",\"lastName\":\"Turner\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Maya\",\"lastName\":\"Hawke\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Molly\",\"lastName\":\"Ringwald\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"LeVar\",\"lastName\":\"Burton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Julia\",\"lastName\":\"Fox\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Charlie\",\"lastName\":\"Gillespie\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michelle\",\"lastName\":\"Hurd\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"King Princess\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Quintessa\",\"lastName\":\"Swindell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-08-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13733\",\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex references\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"One Night Only\",\"synopsis\":\"Academy Award® nominee Monica Barbaro (A Complete Unknown, Top Gun: Maverick) and BAFTA nominee Callum Turner (Masters of the Air, Fantastic Beasts franchise) star as Allie and Owen, two love-starved strangers who crash into each other in an ever-so-slightly fictionalized New York City on the one night of the year when single people are allowed to have sex.\\n\\nRecently dumped Owen and hopeful romantic Allie might be the only two singles in the city looking for more than just a quick encounter. They both feel a spark when they meet, but a series of missteps and side quests complicate their night, keeping them apart. As they each race toward and away from each other across the city, they just might discover that the one thing they want most is closer than they think.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Monica Barbaro\",\"Callum Turner\",\"Maya Hawke\",\"Molly Ringwald\",\"LeVar Burton\",\"Julia Fox\",\"Charlie Gillespie\",\"Michelle Hurd\",\"King Princess\",\"Quintessa Swindell\"],\"direction\":[\"Will Gluck\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/b7/ffb7552f5afb4d4f1775d65fd464093f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e2/25/e2254e11113c3946b5a756e47df89876.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6a/3b/6a3bde5889cfddc2fbfcbd1e1fdeb1ff.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3a/ee/3aee9750224bab18278a57dbfe8b7dae.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4d/96/4d9607340e57e0006fba6c0cdadc1408.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/734c6199e722489702511706715fe1f5.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-08-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex references\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/386711_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/386711_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"320681\",\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"runtime\":5280,\"genres\":\"Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"357707\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9a/a8/9aa8f97b0259b26c61f9c7abbdbcbba6.jpeg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/61/0a/610a889570533db0524830ff8391feb7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/cb/68/cb685d3e6df851a0ae1ec6083525720b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2f/cd/2fcd56279afb7e5f8341b439875af42d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d7/90/d790415267cccc1a3eee0634ffe1b6d1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/ea/d0eac64e471923c188fb90a8f408e2fb.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7e/6f/7e6fce1464e21d820bfca08aae35317b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b7/c9/b7c9c1754d4c4c376201720117c3d33d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ab/12/ab123caaf431ca3754792883a728f05f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8a/c4/8ac45fd2d123f46ec56f85c05509da2e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/ab/06aba445f17ccfd495b33f47c8f8cd92.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2b/0e/2b0e7932653f33d53f1cc737eaea265f.jpeg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6f/c1/6fc1f58ce2c238e4a03cae8674f6114d.jpeg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Cal\",\"lastName\":\"Brunker\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"synopsis\":\"After their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm, the PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs. They meet Rex, a pup who has been stranded on the island for years and has become an expert in all things dino-related. When the PAW Patrol's archrival, Mayor Humdinger, begins recklessly mining in hopes of exploiting the island for its natural resources, he inadvertently causes a huge, dormant volcano to erupt. The PAW Patrol pups are thrown into a series of high-stakes, dino-sized rescues bigger than anything they've done before, as they must stop Humdinger before everything on the island goes extinct.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9a/a8/9aa8f97b0259b26c61f9c7abbdbcbba6.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/357707_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/357707_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/0f825b2731388f17510e00eca12d1f86.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rain\",\"lastName\":\"Janjua\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Carter\",\"lastName\":\"Young\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mckenna\",\"lastName\":\"Grace\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Hayden\",\"lastName\":\"Chamberlen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Henry\",\"lastName\":\"Bolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lucien\",\"lastName\":\"Duncan-Reid\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Nylan\",\"lastName\":\"Parthipan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"William\",\"lastName\":\"Desrosiers\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\