a.net/img/e9/96/e9969ca307879a0768a2393f5d944553.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/25/50/2550ddcd500b780b5488a8bef6471b89.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/48/ea/48eabb3324eca81ce3e7cda3dd74e285.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7f/58/7f584deffe9b6d6f2d1c8cb27a4db7f4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"John\",\"lastName\":\"Carney\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Power Ballad\",\"synopsis\":\"When Rick (Paul Rudd), a past-his-prime wedding singer, meets fading boy-band star Danny (Nick Jonas) during a gig, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But when Danny turns one of Rick’s songs into the hit that reignites his career, Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves - even if it means risking everything he cares about. From writer/director John Carney (Sing Street, Once), POWER BALLAD is a feel-good story about music, self-respect, friendship, and the price of ambition.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a6/02/a6025ecaa8d61ab503599b1ea5afe5a0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/362935_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/362935_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/cf155d348fe1f7c26dcb8f94f109ad04.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paul\",\"lastName\":\"Rudd\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"o