ull,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Power Ballad\",\"synopsis\":\"When Rick (Paul Rudd), a past-his-prime wedding singer, meets fading boy-band star Danny (Nick Jonas) during a gig, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But when Danny turns one of Rick’s songs into the hit that reignites his career, Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves - even if it means risking everything he cares about. From writer/director John Carney (Sing Street, Once), POWER BALLAD is a feel-good story about music, self-respect, friendship, and the price of ambition.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Paul Rudd\",\"Nick Jonas\",\"Havana Rose Liu\",\"Jack Reynor\",\"Marcella Plunkett\",\"Beth Fallon\",\"Rory Keenan\",\"Sophie Vavasseur\",\"Peter McDonald\",\"Paul Reid\"],\"direction\":[\"John Carney\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/53/ff53e9500ae7eb4bde806798b4520487.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/86/07/8607a2ff3eb5b5efeca2c537db45640c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b9/d3/b9d3fd605f3e41108591c4e1e6a71e21.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a3/82/a382674880186945f01da356347b4cf3.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/bc/e9/bce900804800d81ce8513954230f17d2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/22/7b/227b2a17b37f881ffb50f5a0bfe45d0c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e9/96/e9969ca307879a0768a2393f5d944553.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/25/50/2550ddcd500b780b5488a8bef6471b89.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/48/ea/48eabb3324eca81ce3e7cda3dd74e285.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7f/58/7f584deffe9b6d6f2d1c8cb27a4db7f4.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/cf155d348fe1f7c26dcb8f94f109ad04.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-05-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/362935_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD