/11/27/204858.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/15/01/29/11/27/231579.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2015-02-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/162753_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/162753_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"StudioCanal UK\"}},{\"id\":\"1000042684\",\"title\":\"Shrek: 25th Anniversary\",\"runtime\":5400,\"genres\":\"Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Family\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"414413\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/be/6f/be6f05e592e2e8f8702fab54fb4be3df.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Andrew\",\"lastName\":\"Adamson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Vicky\",\"lastName\":\"Jenson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Shrek: 25th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"Once upon a time, in a far away swamp, there lived an ornery ogre named Shrek whose precious solitude is suddenly shattered by an invasion of annoying fairy tale characters. There are blind mice in his food, a big, bad wolf in his bed, three little homeless pigs and more, all banished from their kingdom by the evil Lord Farquaad. Determined to save their home--not to mention his own--Shrek cuts a deal with Farquaad and sets out to rescue the beautiful Princess Fiona to be Farquaad's bride. Accompanying him on his mission is wisecracking Donkey, who will do anything for Shrek... except shut up. Rescuing the Princess from a fire-breathing dragon may prove the least of their problems when the deep, dark secret she has been keeping is revealed.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/be/6f/be6f05e592e2e8f8702fab54fb4be3df.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/bc8cc562cd6392379793fd04f34c6f1c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"26962\",\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains very mild bad language and mild comic violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mike\",\"lastName\":\"Myers\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Eddie\",\"lastName\":\"Murphy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cameron\",\"lastName\":\"Diaz\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"John\",\"lastName\":\"Lithgow\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vincent\",\"lastName\":\"Cassel\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Shrek: 25th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"Once upon a time, in a far away swamp, there lived an ornery ogre named Shrek whose precious solitude is suddenly shattered by an invasion of annoying fairy tale characters. There are blind mice in his food, a big, bad wolf in his bed, three little homeless pigs and more, all banished from their kingdom by the evil Lord Farquaad. Determined to save their home--not to mention his own--Shrek cuts a deal with Farquaad and sets out to rescue the beautiful Princess Fiona to be Farquaad's bride. Accompanying him on his mission is wisecracking Donkey, who will do anything for Shrek... except shut up. Rescuing the Princess from a fire-breathing dragon may prove the least of their problems when the deep, dark secret she has been keeping is revealed.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Mike Myers\",\"Eddie Murphy\",\"Cameron Diaz\",\"John Lithgow\",\"Vincent Cassel\"],\"direction\":[\"Andrew Adamson\",\"Vicky Jenson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/bc8cc562cd6392379793fd04f34c6f1c.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains very mild bad language and mild comic violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\"}},{\"id\":\"1000027188\",\"title\":\"Singh vs Kaur 2\",\"runtime\":9300,\"genres\":\"Romance, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"395940\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/af/09/af094d70e576a161e3fa906fa783a9f3.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Navaniat\",\"lastName\":\"Singh\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Singh vs Kaur 2\",\"synopsis\":\"Nehal, son of a martyred Army soldier, dreams of transforming his Punjab village. With his friend Tari, he convinces villagers to invest in a fish-farming project, but their money is stolen, leaving Nehal branded a fraud. His search leads to Canada, where he discovers Jasneet was forced into the crime after her brother was kidnapped by a drug syndicate. Together, they battle the criminals, recover the money, and restore Nehal's honor and his father's legacy.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/af/09/af094d70e576a161e3fa906fa783a9f3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/605ddfcb134b5090dbccb9f78ef09fba.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gippy\",\"lastName\":\"Grewal\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Shehnaaz\",\"lastName\":\"Gill\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Prince\",\"lastName\":\"Kanwaljeet\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Raghveer\",\"lastName\":\"Boli\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Honey\",\"lastName\":\"Mattu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gulzar Inder\",\"lastName\":\"Chahal\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rupinder\",\"lastName\":\"Rupi\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gurpreet\",\"lastName\":\"Bhangu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gurmeet\",\"lastName\":\"Saajan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bhana\",\"lastName\":\"La\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000112633\",\"name\":\"Omjee\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Singh vs Kaur 2\",\"synopsis\":\"Nehal, son of a martyred Army soldier, dreams of transforming his Punjab village. With his friend Tari, he convinces villagers to invest in a fish-farming project, but their money is stolen, leaving Nehal branded a fraud. His search leads to Canada, where he discovers Jasneet was forced into the crime after her brother was kidnapped by a drug syndicate. Together, they battle the criminals, recover the money, and restore Nehal's honor and his father's legacy.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Gippy Grewal\",\"Shehnaaz Gill\",\"Prince Kanwaljeet\",\"Raghveer Boli\",\"Honey Mattu\",\"Gulzar Inder Chahal\",\"Rupinder Rupi\",\"Gurpreet Bhangu\",\"Gurmeet Saajan\",\"Bhana La\"],\"direction\":[\"Navaniat Singh\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/605ddfcb134b5090dbccb9f78ef09fba.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Omjee\"},\"orderIndex\":69},{\"id\":\"1000019386\",\"title\":\"Spa Weekend\",\"runtime\":5580,\"genres\":\"Comedy\",