20c57d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a8/31/a831fc986328c82479304f9b447f9b51.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/63/79/6379cb96f162522ff1baa53eb5942b81.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/01/e8/01e84d906688dea0a5b6cceb4a15a32a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/db/26/db26b7387f1b55f1bd7c22cd3bde062f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1d/eb/1deb9064a2ea03b9f7ac303e7b4b71b8.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3c/f4/3cf4601f7879920845952e04d34bf9e2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e6/7d/e67d8524f254e28b3f9670f442219f4f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/85/67/8567617d9879bba9e7fd9f40c3d1576f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/eb/77/eb7758bdb4c2f7966d902e1c607b72b2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Cameron\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Terminator 2: Judgment Day 35th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"From visionary director James Cameron, Terminator 2: Judgment Day is the ultimate sci-fi blockbuster that redefined action forever. Arnold Schwarzenegger is back. This time, he’s the protector. In a future ruled by machines, young John Connor holds the key to humanity’s survival. When a reprogrammed Terminator is sent back in time to protect him, a new threat emerges: the T-1000, a terrifying next-generation assassin capable of becoming anyone, anywhere. No rules. No limits. No mercy. As Sarah Connor races to stop Judgment Day before it begins, the fate of humanity hangs by a thread. Winner of multiple Academy Awards, T2 delivers iconic action, legendary one-liners, and groundbreaking visual effects that changed cinema forever. Back on the big screen this Judgment Day for the 35th anniversary.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9c/69/9c694acc2704a36561e37738f95e5f48.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/92155fcc2ba5a9ad7741dc983be1e0f5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Arnold\",\"lastName\":\"Schwarzenegger\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Linda\",\"lastName\":\"Hamilton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Edward\",\"lastName\":\"Furlong\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Robert\",\"lastName\":\"Patrick\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Earl\",\"lastName\":\"Boen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joe\",\"lastName\":\"Morton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"S. Epatha\",\"lastName\":\"Merkerson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Castulo\",\"lastName\":\"Guerra\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Danny\",\"lastName\":\"Cooksey\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jenette\",\"lastName\":\"Goldstein\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"9447\",\"name\":\"StudioCanal UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong violence, language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Terminator 2: Judgment Day 35th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"From visionary director James Cameron, Terminator 2: Judgment Day is the ultimate sci-fi blockbuster that redefined action forever. Arnold Schwarzenegger is back. This time, he’s the protector. In a future ruled by machines, young John Connor holds the key to humanity’s survival. When a reprogrammed Terminator is sent back in time to protect him, a new threat emerges: the T-1000, a terrifying next-generation assassin capable of becoming anyone, anywhere. No rules. No limits. No mercy. As Sarah Connor races to stop Judgment Day before it begins, the fate of humanity hangs by a thread. Winner of multiple Academy Awards, T2 delivers iconic action, legendary one-liners, and groundbreaking visual effects that changed cinema forever. Back on the big screen this Judgment Day for the 35th anniversary.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Arnold Schwarzenegger\",\"Linda Hamilton\",\"Edward Furlong\",\"Robert Patrick\",\"Earl Boen\",\"Joe Morton\",\"S. Epatha Merkerson\",\"Castulo Guerra\",\"Danny Cooksey\",\"Jenette G